    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pat Callanan Property Sales Ltd. is delighted to present this exceptional detached residence to the market for sale by private treaty.\n\nLocated at 2 Pairc Na Ri, Athenry, Co. Galway, H65 V603, this superb family home enjoys a prime location just a short stroll from Athenry Town Centre. Athenry is one of Galway's most sought-after commuter towns, offering an excellent range of schools, shops, cafes, restaurants, sporting facilities, and everyday amenities. The property is within walking distance of Athenry Train Station and only minutes from the M6 motorway, providing outstanding connectivity to Galway City, Dublin, Limerick, and beyond, making it an ideal choice for commuters.\n\nTo the front, the property boasts an attractive partial stone facade, a paved pedestrian pathway, and beautifully maintained planted flower beds, creating an inviting first impression.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright, tiled entrance hallway leading to a spacious living room featuring a solid fuel stove, creating a warm and cosy atmosphere. French doors open into the stunning open-plan kitchen and dining area, the true heart of the home. The contemporary fitted kitchen is finished to a high standard and includes a stylish island unit, offering ample workspace and an ideal setting for both everyday family living and entertaining. A practical utility room and a guest W.C. complete the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are four generously proportioned bedrooms, including a superb main bedroom with fitted sliding wardrobes and a modern en-suite bathroom. A well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms.\n\nThe private rear garden has been thoughtfully designed with a paved patio area, lawn, raised flower beds, and a timber garden shed, providing the perfect outdoor space for relaxation and entertaining.\n\nThis impressive home boasts an excellent A3 BER rating and benefits from an energy-efficient air-to-water heating system with underfloor heating throughout the ground floor, ensuring year-round comfort and lower running costs.\n\nTastefully decorated throughout and presented in true turnkey condition, this outstanding home is ready for immediate occupation. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Pat Callanan Property Sales Ltd. on 091 844818."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (15.65ft x 5.77ft) Tiles to floor, carpet to stairs<br>Living Room (12.76ft x 15.65ft) Timber to floor, solid fuel stove, built in shelving<br>Kitchen (8.76ft x 14.17ft) Tiles to floor, contemporary fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, island unit with sink, pantry<br>Dining Area (10.10ft x 14.17ft) Tiles to floor, double door access to rear garden<br>Utility Room (5.61ft x 6.86ft) Tiles to floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, fitted storage units<br>Guest WC (5.61ft x 4.56ft) Tiles to floor<br>Hallway (11.65ft x 6.10ft) Carpet to floor<br>Main Bedroom (11.25ft x 15.03ft) Carpet to floor, Slider style wardrobes, vanity area, ensuite<br>En-suite (7.71ft x 3.41ft) Tiles to floor and walls, shower<br>Bedroom 2 (10.47ft x 8.37ft) Carpet to floor, built in slider style wardrobe<br>Main Bathroom (6.86ft x 6.10ft) Tiles to floor and walls, shower over bath<br>Hotpress <br>Bedroom 3 (7.87ft x 10.20ft) Carpet to floor<br>Bedroom 4 (7.25ft x 15.03ft) Carpet to floor, currently used as walk in wardrobe"
